stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SignupInitiated: Manager signs up
    
    SignupInitiated --> PersonalfragebogenInProgress: Starts form
    PersonalfragebogenInProgress --> PersonalfragebogenCompleted: Submits form
    
    PersonalfragebogenCompleted --> ContractGenerated: Proceeds directly (no chatbot/trial)
    
    ContractGenerated --> ContractSigned: RM/Admin confirms signature
    
    ContractSigned --> AwaitingRMAdminReview: Enters pool (target HotelGroup)
    
    AwaitingRMAdminReview --> UnderRMAdminReview: Claimed by RM or Admin
    
    UnderRMAdminReview --> Approved: RM/Admin approves
    UnderRMAdminReview --> Rejected: RM/Admin rejects
    
    Approved --> [*]: Transition to Active (Scope Assigned)
    Rejected --> [*]: Transition to Rejected
